    <description>Swarm에 Slack 채널이 붙는 순간(CollaborationUrl 채워짐) 자동으로 봇을 채널에 참여시키고, Case 소유자(=배정된 담당자)와 CMDT T5_Swarm_Fixed_Participant__mdt의 고정 참여자(오도면 등)를 초대한 뒤 Case 요약을 발신한다. 채널 생성 자체는 표준 관리형 Flow swarming__Begin_Enhanced_Slack_Swarm이 수행. Slack 콜아웃은 Record-Triggered 즉시 경로 불가로 AsyncAfterCommit 경로 실행. 발신은 T5_Send_Slack_Channel_Message subflow 재사용. T5-31 / T5-36.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>ChannelIdFromUrl</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  FIND(&apos;/archives/&apos;, {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}) &gt; 0,
  LEFT(
    MID( {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}, FIND(&apos;/archives/&apos;, {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}) + 10, 255 ),
    FIND(&apos;/&apos;, MID( {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}, FIND(&apos;/archives/&apos;, {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}) + 10, 255 ) &amp; &apos;/&apos;) - 1
  ),
  MID(
    {!$Record.CollaborationUrl},
    FIND(&apos;/client/&apos;, {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}) + 9 + FIND(&apos;/&apos;, MID({!$Record.CollaborationUrl}, FIND(&apos;/client/&apos;, {!$Record.CollaborationUrl}) + 9, 255)),
    255
  )
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>T5 Swarm Created Invite And Summary {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>T5 Swarm Created Invite And Summary</label>
